BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | 3 \leq x \leq 13\}`]
- [`B = \{6, 16\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup A \cup B \cup (A \cap (B)) \cap B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \geq 9\}`]
- [`B = \{2, 4, 7, 9, 11, 15\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup A \cup B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`(B \cup A) \cup (A \cap A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x < 14\}`]
- [`B = \{8, 11, 12, 17, 18\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \geq 5\}`]
- [`B = \{17, 18\}`]
- [`C = \{2, 6, 9, 10, 12, 13\}`]

Compute:
- [`C - (A \cup A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}
- [`A \cup C \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_9}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{11, 14\}`]
- [`B = \{3, 5, 6, 9\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cap B \cup ((((B \cup A) \cup B \cup B) \cup A \cup A)) \cup A \cap ((A) \cup A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_10}
- [`B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_11}

---
END_PGML
